Open the review from the list of signals, not from whoever speaks first. The list is the page. The room argues the page.

If a signal is not on the list, it does not get to move a route in that meeting. Write it down for the next one.

This note is a draft. It is here so you can open the address, see that it is not on the field notes index, and decide whether it should be.
